            "review_text": "Samantha P\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam31 contributions\n0\nEat like a local\nMay 2019 • Friends\nA Vietnamese friend took me here and I really enjoyed my meal and experience. My dish only cost 55k and was extremely filling. It was a very relaxed atmosphere with nothing but locals, although the menu does have English translations making it easy for foreigners to order. Overall, I would gladly return and would encourage others to give this restaurant a chance!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 25, 2019",
